{"data":[{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","created_at":"2025-02-13T13:25:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1890029422851625058"],"id":"1890029422851625058","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":320147,"like_count":103,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"轻易不要尝试和亲人发生关系，因为 乱 会上瘾！新年能吃到二姐的大闷儿要感谢这个假酒，三罐麦克雷喝吐了酒精沙场的二姐，前两罐还很正常，喝完第三罐突然就醉到不省人事了，这个酒有毒吧？ https://t.co/uCFiRoOK0Y","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1890029422851625058"},{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","created_at":"2025-02-11T12:50:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1889295925824123056"],"id":"1889295925824123056","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":70,"impression_count":332206,"like_count":424,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":92,"retweet_count":27},"text":"想起前天操烂醉的二姐鸡就硬邦邦，吐完的二姐一滩烂泥的跪趴在马桶前撅着骚屁股任我摆布，撕烂二姐的丝袜，扶着她大屁股对着阴道把整根肉棒没入进去，随后拉住二姐的双手十指紧扣，让她上半身悬空，随着我抽动的节奏拽着她的身体朝后猛猛的抽动撞击，二姐醉到完全放飞自我只剩下骚母狗的本能大声呻吟","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1889295925824123056"},{"author_id":"1676602451569307649","created_at":"2025-02-09T13:03:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1888574458287247691"],"id":"1888574458287247691","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":89,"impression_count":816168,"like_count":669,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":24},"text":"好好照顾照顾喝断片的二姐🥵 https://t.co/eWqCoVFyOt","url":"https://x.com/woaierjie/status/1888574458287247691"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1676602451569307649","name":"住在二姐家","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1710272374078324736/tmwJ8KPy_normal.jpg","username":"woaierjie","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1890029422851625058","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3frr9tsnm2ny1g6crc5baodluc30osd","oldest_id":"1888574458287247691","result_count":3}}